### DB smoke - patient service
GET http://localhost:4004/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
### DB smoke - doctor service
GET http://localhost:4004/api/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
### DB smoke - clinical service
GET http://localhost:4004/api/medical-records/patient/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
### DB smoke - pharmacy service
GET http://localhost:4004/api/pharmacy/medicines
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
### DB smoke - appointment service
GET http://localhost:4004/api/appointment/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
### DB smoke - billing service
GET http://localhost:4004/api/billing/accounts/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
### Read model/analytics smoke
GET http://localhost:4004/api/analytics/patients/count?date=2026-04-01
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
### Swagger aggregate from gateway
GET http://localhost:4004/swagger-ui.html

